{"speciesId":698,"names":{"fr":"Amagara","es":"Amaura","en":"Amaura","ja":"アマルス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Pokémon ancien, ramené à la vie après la découverte d’une partie de son corps conservée dans la glace pendant 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon que ha sido regenerado a partir de un trozo de su antiguo cuerpo, que quedó congelado hace unos 100 millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This ancient Pokémon was restored from part of its body that had been frozen in ice for over 100 million years."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"１億年前から 氷漬けに なっていた 体の 一部から 復活した 古代の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon placide vivait dans des contrées au climat froid, loin de la menace d’un violent prédateur comme Rexillius."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon de carácter sosegado. Habitaba en lugares fríos donde no existían depredadores tan feroces como Tyrantrum."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"This calm Pokémon lived in a cold land where there were no violent predators like Tyrantrum."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"おっとりした 性格の ポケモン。 ガチゴラスなど 凶暴な 敵の いない 寒い 土地に 住んでいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon ancien, ramené à la vie après la découverte d’une partie de son corps conservée dans la glace pendant 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon que ha sido regenerado a partir de un trozo de su antiguo cuerpo, que quedó congelado hace unos 100 millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This ancient Pokémon was restored from part of its body that had been frozen in ice for over 100 million years."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１億年前から 氷漬けに なっていた 体の 一部から 復活した 古代の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon placide vivait dans des contrées au climat froid, loin de la menace d’un violent prédateur comme Rexillius."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon de carácter sosegado. Habitaba en lugares fríos donde no existían depredadores tan feroces como Tyrantrum."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This calm Pokémon lived in a cold land where there were no violent predators like Tyrantrum."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"おっとりした 性格の ポケモン。 ガチゴラスなど 凶暴な 敵の いない 寒い 土地に 住んでいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Amagara vivait jadis dans les terres glacées. On dit que lorsqu’il pousse un cri, une aurore boréale nimbe le ciel nocturne."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Vivía en zonas gélidas en épocas pasadas y, según dicen, el sonido que emite provoca la aparición de auroras boreales nocturnas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It lived in cold areas in ancient times. It’s said that when Amaura whinnies, auroras appear in the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"古代の 寒い土地に 棲んでいた。 アマルスが いななくとき 夜空に オーロラが 現れる という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il a été reconstitué, mais son corps n’est pas adapté aux températures actuelles, ce qui affecte probablement son espérance de vie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Aunque se ha regenerado con éxito, las cálidas temperaturas actuales no le son propicias y afectan a su esperanza de vida."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Amaura was restored successfully, but it’s not expected to live long because of the heat of the current environment."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"復元に 成功したが 今の 環境は 暑過ぎて 長生きは できないと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon a été ressuscité à partir d’un fossile. Jadis, il vivait en meute dans des terres froides, où peu de ses prédateurs résidaient."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon ha sido regenerado a partir de un fósil. Habitaba en manadas en lugares fríos donde los depredadores escaseaban."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon was successfully restored from a fossil. In the past, it lived with others of its kind in cold lands where there were fewer predators."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"化石から 復元が 成功。 敵の 少ない 寒い土地で 群れを つくり 暮らしていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Un Pokémon ancien qui s’est éteint. On trouve parfois des spécimens conservés dans la glace."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Un Pokémon prehistórico extinto. Se han hallado algunos ejemplares conservados bajo el hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Amaura is an ancient Pokémon that has gone extinct. Specimens of this species can sometimes be found frozen in ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"全滅した 古代の ポケモン。 氷漬けの 状態で 発見されることも あるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":698,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[15,"level-up",18],[16,"level-up",18],[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18],[20,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[15,"level-up",50],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",50],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",50],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",50],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[15,"level-up",65],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",65],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",65],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",65],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",52],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"aurora-beam","learns":[[15,"level-up",20],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"level-up",57],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",57],[16,"machine",0